title: metarecord:field
tags: [[GUI command]] Metarecord
kind: reference
summary: Field operation on this metarecord

Changes a field of the selected metarecord from the command input: `metarecord:field <set|add|edit|remove|unset|rename|retype> <field> …`, each missing argument asked with completion ([[Editing metarecords in the GUI]]).
